# Delivered art batches. `piggles/images/` is a DROP ZONE, not source: raw PNG /
# WebP / JPG / .ai from the illustrator, plus the manifest, character map and
# usage matrix that ship alongside each batch. `piggles/packages/mascot/scripts/ingest.mjs`
# READS this directory; nothing builds from it.
#
# It is here because it was blocking pushes. Every new batch lands as ~5
# unformatted files, and `format:check` scans the whole working tree — so a
# release could not go out while a delivery was being ingested, for the
# formatting of a vendor's manifest. Reformatting a delivery also puts our diff
# noise between us and the thing we were sent.
#
# Scoped to the drop zone only. Anything under piggles/packages/mascot — the code that
# reads these — is ordinary source and stays formatted.
piggles/images/**

